(4583388, 661105, 59029, '<td valign="top">He looks like a little kid playing dress-up. No sense of attitude or defiance here, just a nostril shot....no tats, no piercings, no stubble ...everything looks way too new.<br/>In real mug shots they make you remove headgear and any type of glasses.  He''d be more convincing against a plain backdrop, some makeup if he''s not yet old enough to grow stubble, no shades, no do-rag, a much scruffier jacket and a direct glare at the camera. <br/>Try your local charity shop for inexpensive props, like a leather jacket that''s seen a lot of use.  Good try.</td>', 'He looks like a little kid playing dress-up. No sense of attitude or defiance here, just a nostril shot....no tats, no piercings, no stubble ...everything looks way too new.In real mug shots they make you remove headgear and any type of glasses.  He''d be more convincing against a plain backdrop, some makeup if he''s not yet old enough to grow stubble, no shades, no do-rag, a much scruffier jacket and a direct glare at the camera. Try your local charity shop for inexpensive props, like a leather jacket that''s seen a lot of use.  Good try.', '2008-03-24 12:40:19.000000', NULL, 1),
