(4590694, 661299, 15976, '<td valign="top">This is one of the better ones.  First mug shots are in black and white and you did that.  No shadows, low contrast, expressionless and you did that.  Hair messed up another plus.  <br/> <br/>My only criticism is the face has too much "dirt" on it and your eyes are too pretty to look criminal.  Maybe if you had runny eyemakeup that would have helped....still giving it a 9 tho.</td>', 'This is one of the better ones.  First mug shots are in black and white and you did that.  No shadows, low contrast, expressionless and you did that.  Hair messed up another plus.   My only criticism is the face has too much "dirt" on it and your eyes are too pretty to look criminal.  Maybe if you had runny eyemakeup that would have helped....still giving it a 9 tho.', '2008-03-27 05:51:55.000000', NULL, 1),
