(4594609, 661513, 70299, '<td valign="top">very creative and nicely done!</td>', 'very creative and nicely done!', '2008-03-28 22:10:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4594619, 659831, 70299, '<td valign="top">Except that it''s not the right kind of "mugshot."  The picture itself lacks contrast.  It''s artsy, and I like that.  Use brighten and contrast and a bit of saturation...then add a texture layer over it to make it look like a painting.  Then I think you have a very nice image to show off outside of this challenge!  The cropping is great...maybe a bit of the reflection on the bottom cut off.</td>', 'Except that it''s not the right kind of "mugshot."  The picture itself lacks contrast.  It''s artsy, and I like that.  Use brighten and contrast and a bit of saturation...then add a texture layer over it to make it look like a painting.  Then I think you have a very nice image to show off outside of this challenge!  The cropping is great...maybe a bit of the reflection on the bottom cut off.', '2008-03-28 22:13:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4594623, 660456, 70299, '<td valign="top">Very good use of lighting, contrast and tones! 8</td>', 'Very good use of lighting, contrast and tones! 8', '2008-03-28 22:14:27.000000', NULL, 1),
