(4594871, 661203, 76430, '<td valign="top">you look LOST.  Yet another purpose for that set of numbers.  It''s not very sharp or lit very well.  Good creative idea though.</td>', 'you look LOST.  Yet another purpose for that set of numbers.  It''s not very sharp or lit very well.  Good creative idea though.', '2008-03-29 01:23:37.000000', NULL, 1),
