(4594874, 661527, 76430, '<td valign="top">It looks overly sharpened with major halos around the head.  The picture is not very sharp though.  You must have done some major post-processing on a shot that didn''t start out very good.  You should have taken a few more shots to try to get a good one to start with.  All that said, I like the smile.</td>', 'It looks overly sharpened with major halos around the head.  The picture is not very sharp though.  You must have done some major post-processing on a shot that didn''t start out very good.  You should have taken a few more shots to try to get a good one to start with.  All that said, I like the smile.', '2008-03-29 01:25:38.000000', NULL, 1),
