(4596557, 661527, 76598, '<td valign="top">This photo has an incredible potential, the angle of view, the teeth, and the smile are really engaging.  However, it is out of focus, seems to have been over manipulated post processing and would benefit from a "light" in the eyes.</td>', 'This photo has an incredible potential, the angle of view, the teeth, and the smile are really engaging.  However, it is out of focus, seems to have been over manipulated post processing and would benefit from a "light" in the eyes.', '2008-03-30 09:35:13.000000', NULL, 1),
