(4596800, 660951, 90495, '<td valign="top">I can''t believe this was the only shot to show 2 angles like in many mugshots I see. Good thinking but I would have used a white bg with the lines to show how tall the suspects are. 8</td>', 'I can''t believe this was the only shot to show 2 angles like in many mugshots I see. Good thinking but I would have used a white bg with the lines to show how tall the suspects are. 8', '2008-03-30 14:04:11.000000', NULL, 1),
